izes a high cacao butter percentage to carry the fresh, bright, and vegetal profile of ceremonial Northern Highlands matcha.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-07-15T09:14:11+07:00","created_at":"2026-07-13T11:32:44+07:00","updated_at":"2026-10-10T20:34:33+07:00","vendor":"Marou Chocolate","product_type":"","tags":["New arrivals","tablets"],"variants":[{"id":45069312327888,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"CHMI0067","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"140000","grams":80,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":8469852946640,"created_at":"2026-07-13T11:32:44+07:00","updated_at":"2026-10-10T20:34:33+07:00"}],"images":[{"id":46859709448400,"created_at":"2026-07-13T11:38:01+07:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-07-13T11:38:03+07:00","product_id":8469852946640,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0646\/0955\/0544\/files\/vietnamese-matcha-coconut-40-white-chocolate-bar.jpg?v=1783917483","width":2500,"height":2500},{"id":46859709481168,"created_at":"2026-07-13T11:38:01+07:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-07-13T11:38:03+07:00","product_id":8469852946640,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0646\/0955\/0544\/files\/vietnamese-matcha-coconut-40-white-chocolate-bar-naked.jpg?v=1783917483","width":2500,"height":2500}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":8469852913872,"title":"Vietnamese Matcha \u0026 Coconut 40% White Chocolate Mini Bar","handle":"vietnamese-matcha-coconut-40-white-chocolate-mini-bar","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eA terroir-driven, 40% cacao white chocolate that replaces conventional sweetness with sophisticated depth. Unlike mass-market white chocolate which often relies heavily on sugar, this bar utilizes a high cacao butter percentage to carry the fresh, bright, and vegetal profile of ceremonial Northern Highlands matcha.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at