tnam Origin Blend Coffee In Collaboration With Building Coffee","handle":"vietnam-origin-blend-coffee-building-coffee","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eWe have partnered with Building Coffee to create an exclusive Signature House Blend crafted specifically for our café and customers. This medium roast combines 60% Da Lat Arabica with 40% Gia Lai Robusta Vietnamese beans roasted with precision to complement and elevate the distinctive flavors of our award-winning chocolate.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEvery cup served at Maison Marou features this carefully curated blend, designed to bring out the best in both coffee and chocolate. Enjoy the same exceptional blend we serve daily in our café. Available in both whole bean and ground formats.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-10T20:34:01+07:00","created_at":"2025-02-10T20:34:00+07:00","updated_at":"2026-10-10T20:34:33+07:00","vendor":"Marou Chocolate","product_type":"","tags":["provisions","Vegan"],"variants":[{"id":44410936656080,"title":"Whole bean","option1":"Whole bean","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"FGOT2006","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"250000","grams":250,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":8249753338064,"created_at":"2025-02-10T20:34:13+07:00","updated_at":"2026-10-10T20:34:33+07:00"},{"id":44410936688848,"title":"Ground bean","option1":"Ground bean","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"FGOT2005","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"250000","grams":250,"compare_at_price":null,"position":2,"product_id":8249753338064,"created_at":"2025-02-10T20:34:13+07:00","updated_at":"2026-10-10T20:34:33+07:00"}],"images":[{"id":41445558714576,"created_at":"2025-04-01T09:57:49+07:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-04-01T09:58:35+07:00","product_id":8249753338064,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0646\/0955\/0544\/files\/maison-marou-x-building-signature-house-blend-coff